    "headline": "Winter Storm Warning issued November 1 at 10:57AM MST until November 2 at 11:00AM MST by NWS Pueblo CO",
    "description": "* WHAT...Heavy snow expected. Total snow accumulations 8 to 14\ninches. Winds gusting as high as 50 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Eastern San Juan Mountains Above 10000 Feet.\n\n* WHEN...From 5 PM this afternoon to 11 AM MST Monday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Travel could be very difficult, especially tonight and\nMonday morning over Wolf Creek Pass and Cumbres Pass. Strong winds\ncould produce areas of blowing and drifting snow.",
    "instruction": "If you must travel, keep an extra flashlight, food, and water in your\nvehicle in case of an emergency. The latest road conditions for the\nstate you are calling from can be obtained by calling 5 1 1.",
